cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Tensorium"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, in-browser explorer and debugger for large language model
  internals. Loads a Hugging Face model's real config and safetensors
  weights, renders its architecture as a navigable graph, runs an actual
  forward pass client-side (no backend, no GPU), and supports tensor
  inspection, logit-lens analysis, token attribution, and causal
  interventions.
type: software
authors:
